sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User
  participant W as Chat panel (webview)
  participant E as Extension host
  participant A as friday agent (ACP)
  participant G as Friday gateway
  participant D as VS Code editor

  U->>W: Type a message (+ pasted image, @file)
  W->>E: send(text, attachments)
  E->>E: Add editor context (folder, open file, selection, problems)
  E->>A: session/prompt (context block + files + text)
  A->>G: Chat completion with tools (Bearer fxt_)
  G-->>A: Streamed tokens (credits metered)
  A-->>E: session/update agent_thought_chunk / agent_message_chunk
  E-->>W: update events
  W-->>U: Orb "Thinking", streamed answer
  A-->>E: tool_call (edit) + diff
  A->>E: session/request_permission
  E->>D: Open diff (Accept / Reject in title bar)
  E-->>W: Permission card with the same diff
  U->>D: Accept (or Reject, or answer in chat)
  D->>E: answer
  E-->>A: selected option
  A->>A: Write file, run command, spawn subagent
  A-->>E: tool_call_update (output streams, subagent id)
  E-->>W: Step cards, mascots while a subagent works
  A-->>E: stopReason end_turn
  E->>G: GET /me (usage meter refresh)
  E-->>W: usage percent + reset time
